hadiths[35]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1009","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ibn Utba ibn Masud from Abdullah ibn Abbas that Sad ibn Ubada questioned the Messenger of Allah"
"1010","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr that his paternal aunt related that her grandmother made a vow to walk to the Quba mosque. She died"
"1011","Yahya related to me from Malik that Abdullah ibn Abi Habiba said"
"1012","Yahya related to me from Malik that Urwa ibn Udhayna al-Laythi said"
"1014","Yahya related to me from Malik that Yahya ibn Said said"
"1015","Yahya related to me from Malik that what he preferred of what he had heard from the people of knowledge about a man or woman who vowed to walk to the House of Allah"
"1016","Yahya related to me from Malik that Yahya ibn Said heard al-Qasim ibn Muhammad say"
"1017","Yahya related to me from Malik from Talha ibn Abi al-Malik al- Ayli from al-Qasim ibn Muhammad ibn as-Siddiq from A'isha that the Messenger of Allah"
"1018","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father that A'isha"
"1019","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar said"
"1020","Yahya related to me from Malik from Suhayl ibn Abi Salih from his father from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1021","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar said"
"1022","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar used to do kaffara for a broken oath by feeding ten poor people. Each person got a mudd of wheat. He sometimes freed a slave if he had repeated the oath"
"1023","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Sulayman ibn Yasar said"
"1024","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that one time the Messenger of Allah"
"1025","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that the Messenger of Allah"
"1026","Yahya related to me from Malik from Uthman ibn Hafs ibn Umar ibn Khalda that Ibn Shihab had heard that Abu Lubaba ibn Abd al-Mundhir"
"1027","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ayyub ibn Musa from Mansur ibn Abd ar-Rahman al-Hajabi from his mother that A'isha"
"1056","Yahya related to me from Malik that he heard Nafi say that Abdullah ibn Umar said"
"1059","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam that Sad al- Jari"
"1060","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad from Abu Salama ibn Abd ar-Rahman from Abu Hurayra and Zayd ibn Thabit that they saw no harm in eating what was cast up by the sea"
"1061","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad from Abu Salama ibn Abd ar-Rahman that some people from al-Jar came to Marwan ibn al- Hakam and asked him about eating what was cast up by the sea. He said"
"1062","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shibab from Abu Idris al- Khawlani from Abu Tha~laba al-Khushani that the Messenger of Allah"
"1063","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ismail ibn Abi Hakim from Abiyda ibn Sufyan al-Hadrami from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1064","Yahya related to me from Malik that the best of what he had heard about horses"
"1065","Malik related to me from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ibn Wala al-Misri from Abdullah ibn Abbas that the Messenger of Allah"
"1066","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yazid ibn Abdullah ibn Qusayt from Muhammad ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Thawban from his mother that A'isha"
"1067","Yahya related to me from Malik that the best of what he had heard about a man who is forced by necessity to eat carrion is that he ate it until he was full and then he took provision from it. If he found something which would enable him to dispense with it"
"1068","Yahya related to me from Malik from Jafar ibn Muhammad that his father said"
"1069","Yahya related to me from Malik from Rabia ibn Abi Abd ar-Rahman that Muhammad ibn Ali ibn al-Husayn said"
"1070","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that if any of Abdullah ibn Umar's family asked him for an aqiqa"
"1071","Yahya related to me from Malik from Rabia ibn Abi Abd ar-Rahman that Muhammad ibn Ibrahim ibn al-Harith at-Taymi said"
"1072","Yahya related to me from Malik that he heard that there had been an aqiqa for Hasan and Husayn"
"1073","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa that his father"
"1074","Yahya related to me from Malik"